        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_SHAPES" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L4 — Shape Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Process · Store · Artifact · Decision · Control · Graph node · Off-page&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Shape Legend on PAGE_00&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: ShapeLegendArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Process · Store · Artifact · Decision · Control · Graph node · Off-page&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: Pluggable representation adapter with artifact provenance; unselected models remain configuration-only.&#xa;Artifacts: ShapeLegendArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1030" y="120" width="600" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_EDGES" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L5 — Edge Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Data · Control · Optional · Fallback · Evidence · Artifact · Match&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Edge Legend on PAGE_00&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: EdgeLegendArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Data · Control · Optional · Fallback · Evidence · Artifact · Match&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Deterministic policy/registry/budget implementation with allow-listed actions and traceable fallback.&#xa;Artifacts: EdgeLegendArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1670" y="120" width="580" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_OFFPAGE" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L6 — Off-page Connector&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stable reference to another architecture page&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Off-page Connector on PAGE_00&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: Off-pageConnectorArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Stable reference to another architecture page&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving serialization.&#xa;Artifacts: Off-pageConnectorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=offPageConnector;size=0.15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2290" y="120" width="620" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_REP" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L7 — Representation Levels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Technical/Retrieval Frame → Event Interval → Semantic Moment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Representation Levels on PAG…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; execution context to Execution Modes [P00_MODES]" tooltip="Responsibility: Technical/Retrieval Frame → Event Interval → Semantic Moment&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not emit a verified answer when raw evidence is insufficient.&#xa;Implementation: Raw-video/evidence adapter with bounded dense decoding and explicit verification states.&#xa;Artifacts: RepresentationLevelsArtifact&#xa;Metrics: frame-window hit → evidence coverage → localization latency&#xa;Failure modes: raw evidence unavailable or insufficient to verify/localize the requested moment&#xa;Fallback: Refine or re-search within budget; otherwise return insufficient evidence without an answer.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#881337;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="500" width="620" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_MODES" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L8 — Execution Modes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Offline preprocessing · Online query execution&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; execution context from Representation Levels [P00_REP]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; query route to Query Lanes [P00_LANES]" tooltip="Responsibility: Offline preprocessing · Online query execution&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not silently mix artifacts from incompatible runs or versions.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned artifact/index adapter keyed by stable IDs and RunManifest provenance.&#xa;Artifacts: ExecutionModesArtifact&#xa;Metrics: artifact validity → lookup latency → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: artifact version mismatch, missing manifest or failed lookup&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="500" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_LANES" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L9 — Query Lanes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fast Lane · Graph Lane&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; query route from Execution Modes [P00_MODES]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; governing principles to Architectural Principles [P00_PRINCIP…" tooltip="Responsibility: Fast Lane · Graph Lane&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: QueryLanesArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="500" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_P00_PRINCIPLES" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;L10 — Architectural Principles&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Retrieval first · Graph local · Raw video truth · Evidence before answer · Bounded ag…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; governing principles from Query Lanes [P00_LANES]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: ArchitecturalPrinciplesArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Retrieval first · Graph local · Raw video truth · Evidence before answer · Bounded agent · GNN deferred&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Deterministic policy/registry/budget implementation with allow-listed actions and traceable fallback.&#xa;Artifacts: ArchitecturalPrinciplesArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1640" y="500" width="1270" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_00_E00_01" value="ARTIFACT: independent axis" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="PAGE_00_P00_CRIT" target="PAGE_00_P00_MAT">
