        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_01_P01_VERIFY" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#881337;fontSize=11;" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Evidence Verifier / Q&amp;A Extractor boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not emit a verified answer when raw evidence is insufficient.&#xa;Implementation: Verify grounded task evidence and invoke Q&amp;A extraction only when the active task requires it.&#xa;Artifacts: EvidenceVerifier/Q&amp;AExtractorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: frame-window hit → evidence coverage → localization latency&#xa;Failure modes: raw evidence unavailable or insufficient to verify/localize the requested moment&#xa;Fallback: Refine or re-search within budget; otherwise return insufficient evidence without an answer.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;R7 — Evidence Verifier / Q&amp;A Extractor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Verification and Q&amp;A] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Own the Evidence Verifier / Q&amp;A Extractor boundary and produce only its declared page…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; semantic moments from Semantic Moment Localizer [P01_SML]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; grounded evidence to Evidence Packet [P01_PACKET]" vertex="1">
