        <mxCell id="PAGE_01_P01_PACKET" parent="1" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Evidence Packet boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned envelope for candidate, grounding, provenance, confidence components and verification status.&#xa;Artifacts: EvidencePacketArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;R8 — Evidence Packet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: All tasks] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Own the Evidence Packet boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; grounded evidence from Evidence Verifier / Q&amp;A Extractor [P01…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; rankable evidence to Ranked Answers / Formatter / Evaluator […" vertex="1">
