        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_RAW" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D1 — Raw Data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [CURRENT_TEMPLATE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Raw Data on PAGE_02&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Persist and retrieve Raw Data records by stable identifiers and run version.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Read-only filesystem adapter over configured video roots; emit canonical ma…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; inventory to Data Audit [P02_AUDIT] → audio to Optional ASR [P02_AS…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Raw Data boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not infer semantic events or alter raw source media.&#xa;Implementation: Read-only filesystem adapter over configured video roots; emit canonical manifest entries without downloading or rewriting media.&#xa;Artifacts: RawDataArtifact&#xa;Metrics: schema validity → mapping round-trip accuracy → audit failure count&#xa;Failure modes: invalid manifest or unresolved canonical ID/time mapping&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,KHOA; implementation=KHOA; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
