        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_AUDIT" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D2 — Data Audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [CURRENT_TEMPLATE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; inventory from Raw Data [P02_RAW]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform inventory from Raw Data [P02_RAW] into audited manifest to Unifie…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Schema, checksum, duplicate-ID and media-metadata checks over VideoManifest…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; audited manifest to Unified ID &amp; Temporal Mapping [P02_MAP]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Data Audit boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not infer semantic events or alter raw source media.&#xa;Implementation: Schema, checksum, duplicate-ID and media-metadata checks over VideoManifest records; persist structured audit findings.&#xa;Artifacts: DataAuditArtifact&#xa;Metrics: schema validity → mapping round-trip accuracy → audit failure count&#xa;Failure modes: invalid manifest or unresolved canonical ID/time mapping&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,KHOA; implementation=KHOA; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
