        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_MAP" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D3 — Unified ID &amp; Temporal Mapping&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [CURRENT_TEMPLATE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; audited manifest from Data Audit [P02_AUDIT]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform audited manifest from Data Audit [P02_AUDIT] into parallel BTC br…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Deterministic mapping tables for video_id, frame_id, timestamp and FPS/time…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; parallel BTC branch to BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank [P02_BTC] → paralle…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Unified ID &amp; Temporal Mapping boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not infer semantic events or alter raw source media.&#xa;Implementation: Deterministic mapping tables for video_id, frame_id, timestamp and FPS/timebase with round-trip validation.&#xa;Artifacts: UnifiedID&amp;TemporalMappingArtifact&#xa;Metrics: schema validity → mapping round-trip accuracy → audit failure count&#xa;Failure modes: invalid manifest or unresolved canonical ID/time mapping&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,KHOA; implementation=KHOA; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
