        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_BTC" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B1 — BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: BTC baseline] [BASELINE] [BTC_CONFIRMED]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; parallel BTC branch from Unified ID &amp; Temporal Mapping [P02_MAP]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Persist and retrieve BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank records by stable identifiers…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Load BTC-provided keyframes and mappings as an immutable baseline/fallback…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; BTC frames to BTC Feature / Object Loader [P02_BTCLOAD]" tooltip="Responsibility: Preserve confirmed BTC frames as auxiliary retrieval branch&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: Load BTC-provided keyframes and mappings as an immutable baseline/fallback branch.&#xa;Artifacts: BTCAuxiliaryFrameBankArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHAT; implementation=PHAT; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
