        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_BTCLOAD" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B2 — BTC Feature / Object Loader&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [BASELINE] [BTC_CONFIRMED]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; BTC frames from BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank [P02_BTC]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform BTC frames from BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank [P02_BTC] into BTC featu…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Adapter for BTC CLIP ViT-B/32 features and Faster R-CNN Inception-ResNet-v2…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; BTC features to BTC Frame Vector Index [P02_BTCIDX] → object JSON t…" tooltip="Responsibility: Provide BTC Feature / Object Loader contract&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: Adapter for BTC CLIP ViT-B/32 features and Faster R-CNN Inception-ResNet-v2 object records with provenance checks.&#xa;Artifacts: BTCFeature/ObjectLoaderArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHAT; implementation=PHAT; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
