        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_BTCIDX" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B3 — BTC Frame Vector Index&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [BASELINE] [BTC_CONFIRMED]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; BTC features from BTC Feature / Object Loader [P02_BTCLOAD]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Persist and retrieve BTC Frame Vector Index records by stable identifiers a…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned BTC vector-index adapter; production ANN backend remains a benchm…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: BTCFrameVectorIndexArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Provide BTC Frame Vector Index contract&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not silently mix artifacts from incompatible runs or versions.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned BTC vector-index adapter; production ANN backend remains a benchmark-gated decision.&#xa;Artifacts: BTCFrameVectorIndexArtifact&#xa;Metrics: artifact validity → lookup latency → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: artifact version mismatch, missing manifest or failed lookup&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHUC; implementation=PHUC; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
