        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_TEAM" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T1 — Team Retrieval Frame Bank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CONDITIONAL: Team frame branch enabled] [EXPERIMENTAL] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; parallel team branch from Unified ID &amp; Temporal Mapping [P02_MAP]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Persist and retrieve Team Retrieval Frame Bank records by stable identifier…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Shot-aware team branch with independent artifacts; never replaces or disabl…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; raw video to Shot Detection [P02_SHOT] → clips to Segment / Clip Re…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Team Retrieval Frame Bank boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: Shot-aware team branch with independent artifacts; never replaces or disables the BTC branch.&#xa;Artifacts: TeamRetrievalFrameBankArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Disable this branch explicitly and preserve the deterministic core path with the reason in ExecutionTrace.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHAT; implementation=PHAT; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
