        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_SHOT" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T2 — Shot Detection&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CONDITIONAL: Team Frame Bank enabled] [EXPERIMENTAL] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; raw video from Team Retrieval Frame Bank [P02_TEAM]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform raw video from Team Retrieval Frame Bank [P02_TEAM] into shot int…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; ShotDetector interface with TransNetV2 recorded only as an unselected resea…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; shot intervals to Shot Duration Analysis [P02_DURATION]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Shot Detection boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: ShotDetector interface with TransNetV2 recorded only as an unselected research candidate.&#xa;Artifacts: ShotDetectionArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Disable this branch explicitly and preserve the deterministic core path with the reason in ExecutionTrace.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHAT; implementation=PHAT; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
