        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_QUALITY" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T6 — Quality Filter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CONDITIONAL: Team Frame Bank enabled] [EXPERIMENTAL] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; covered long shots from Long-shot Coverage Fallback [P02_LONG]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform covered long shots from Long-shot Coverage Fallback [P02_LONG] in…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Rule-based blur, corruption and decode-quality gates with rejected-frame pr…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; quality frames to Deduplication [P02_DEDUP]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Quality Filter boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not treat a representation, caption or feature as ground truth.&#xa;Implementation: Rule-based blur, corruption and decode-quality gates with rejected-frame provenance.&#xa;Artifacts: QualityFilterArtifact&#xa;Metrics: coverage → artifact validity → storage/index size&#xa;Failure modes: missing, corrupt or version-incompatible representation artifact&#xa;Fallback: Disable this branch explicitly and preserve the deterministic core path with the reason in ExecutionTrace.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI,PHAT; implementation=PHAT; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
