        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_Q2" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Q2 — put bag on table&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Graph Lane] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; BEFORE from enter room [Q1]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Represent put bag on table as a versioned query-local hypothesis with confi…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenan…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; BEFORE to open box [Q3] → MATCH 0.88 to person places bag on table…" tooltip="Responsibility: QueryEvent put bag on table&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: putbagontableArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
