        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_Q_CONSTRAINT" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Q-C — Query constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Query constraints on PAGE_04&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Document or route the Query constraints architecture contract without execu…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenan…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: QueryconstraintsArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: same_video = HARD · same_actor = SOFT&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: QueryconstraintsArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
