        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_MATCH_MATRIX" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S1 — Event Match Matrix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Graph Lane] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; scored matches from person places bag on table [E9]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate schema, version and provenance for Event Match Matrix before artif…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Compute query-event to candidate-event compatibility components with eviden…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; constraints to Temporal / Entity Solver [SOLVER]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Event Match Matrix boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Compute query-event to candidate-event compatibility components with evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: EventMatchMatrixArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1390" y="850" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_SOLVER" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S2 — Temporal / Entity Solver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Graph Lane] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; constraints from Event Match Matrix [MATCH_MATRIX]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform constraints from Event Match Matrix [MATCH_MATRIX] into Top-M to…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Filtering, dynamic programming, monotonic alignment or constraint-guided be…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Top-M to Top-M Event Chains [TOPM]" tooltip="Responsibility: DP · Beam Search · Monotonic Alignment&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Filtering, dynamic programming, monotonic alignment or constraint-guided beam search; no GNN baseline.&#xa;Artifacts: Temporal/EntitySolverArtifact&#xa;Metrics: chain accuracy → event coverage → hard-constraint violation rate&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1870" y="850" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_TOPM" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S3 — Top-M Event Chains&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Graph Lane] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; Top-M from Temporal / Entity Solver [SOLVER]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate schema, version and provenance for Top-M Event Chains before artif…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenan…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; uncovered event to Gap Detector [GAP]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Top-M Event Chains boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: Top-MEventChainsArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
