        <mxCell id="PAGE_04_GAP" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;S4 — Gap Detector&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Graph Lane] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; uncovered event from Top-M Event Chains [TOPM]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Apply allow-listed control for Gap Detector with budget, validation and tra…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Classify uncovered constraints into local exploit actions or bounded global…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; neighbor/crop/dense/OCR-ASR-VLM to EXPLOIT local gap [EXPLOIT] → re…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Gap Detector boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Classify uncovered constraints into local exploit actions or bounded global exploration.&#xa;Artifacts: GapDetectorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
