        <mxCell id="PAGE_05_P05_ATYPE" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Q2 — Q&amp;A Answer Type Router&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Q&amp;A] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; question from Question [P05_QUESTION]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Apply allow-listed control for Q&amp;A Answer Type Router with budget, validati…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Typed deterministic routing to evidence-specific answer extraction; it is n…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; answer type to Q&amp;A Answer Extractor [P05_EXTRACT]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Q&amp;A Answer Type Router boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not emit a verified answer when raw evidence is insufficient.&#xa;Implementation: Typed deterministic routing to evidence-specific answer extraction; it is not a free-form reasoning model.&#xa;Artifacts: Q&amp;AAnswerTypeRouterArtifact&#xa;Metrics: frame-window hit → evidence coverage → localization latency&#xa;Failure modes: raw evidence unavailable or insufficient to verify/localize the requested moment&#xa;Fallback: Refine or re-search within budget; otherwise return insufficient evidence without an answer.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe4e6;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#881337;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
