        <mxCell id="PAGE_06_P06_T10" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T-10 — Semantic Moment Localizer per Event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: TRAKE] [EXPERIMENTAL] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; next from Top-M Chains [P06_T9]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform next from Top-M Chains [P06_T9] into next to Chain Verification […&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Apply the moment-type localizer independently to each verified TRAKE event…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; next to Chain Verification [P06_T11]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Semantic Moment Localizer per Event boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Apply the moment-type localizer independently to each verified TRAKE event in chain order.&#xa;Artifacts: SemanticMomentLocalizerperEventArtifact&#xa;Metrics: per-event frame-window hit → chain moment localization error&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1690" y="1330" width="480" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_06_P06_T11" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T-11 — Chain Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: TRAKE] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; next from Semantic Moment Localizer per Event [P06_T10]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform next from Semantic Moment Localizer per Event [P06_T10] into next…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenan…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; next to Ranked TRAKE Answers [P06_T12]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Chain Verification boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: ChainVerificationArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
