        <mxCell id="PAGE_06_P06_T12" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;T-12 — Ranked TRAKE Answers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: TRAKE] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; next from Chain Verification [P06_T11]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate schema, version and provenance for Ranked TRAKE Answers before art…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenan…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: RankedTRAKEAnswersArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Ranked TRAKE Answers boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not build a rich full-corpus graph, hard-merge identity or assert causal truth.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned query-local attributed graph with confidence components, provenance and evidence references.&#xa;Artifacts: RankedTRAKEAnswersArtifact&#xa;Metrics: event coverage → constraint satisfaction → graph/solver latency&#xa;Failure modes: unresolved graph reference, contradictory hard constraint or insufficient event coverage&#xa;Fallback: Return to candidate retrieval or bounded local refinement; abstain when hard constraints remain unresolved.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#7c2d12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
