        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_G07_ENV" value="F — Execution Environment" style="swimlane;html=1;rounded=1;collapsible=0;startSize=38;horizontal=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontStyle=1;fontSize=18;opacity=28;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2160" y="950" width="1180" height="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_BACKEND" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;A1 — Application Backend / Orchestrator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; query + feedback from Interactive UI / Operator Console [P07_UI] →…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Apply allow-listed control for Application Backend / Orchestrator with budg…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Single application-service boundary for sessions, core-pipeline calls, feed…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; candidate/evidence/trace to Application I/O Contract [P07_APPIO]" tooltip="Responsibility: Single application service: receive query/session/feedback, invoke pipeline, return candidates/evidence, create submission and trace&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Single application-service boundary for sessions, core-pipeline calls, feedback, results and traces; not microservices.&#xa;Artifacts: ApplicationBackend/OrchestratorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="120" width="700" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_APPIO" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;A2 — Application I/O Contract&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; candidate/evidence/trace from Application Backend / Orchestrator [P…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate schema, version and provenance for Application I/O Contract before…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving seriali…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; interactive evidence to Evidence Packet [P07_PACKET]" tooltip="Responsibility: Input query/task/session/feedback · Output candidates/EvidencePacket/answer/chain/submission&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving serialization.&#xa;Artifacts: ApplicationI/OContractArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="120" width="700" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_UI" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B1 — Interactive UI / Operator Console&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Interactive UI / Operator Console…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform External or page-entry input for Interactive UI / Operator Consol…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Operator UI contract for query/task input, video-grouped results, timeline,…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; query + feedback to Application Backend / Orchestrator [P07_BACKEND]" tooltip="Responsibility: Query/task, result grid by video, timeline, neighbors, preview, within-video search, evidence/event-chain/Q&amp;A panels, feedback, submission&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Operator UI contract for query/task input, video-grouped results, timeline, neighbors, preview, evidence, feedback and submission.&#xa;Artifacts: InteractiveUI/OperatorConsoleArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1710" y="120" width="750" height="220" as="geometry" />
