        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_ADV" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;B2 — Advanced Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[OPTIONAL: Advanced UI enabled] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; advanced only from Execution Trace [P07_TRACE]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Document or route the Advanced Mode architecture contract without executing…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving seriali…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: AdvancedModeArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: Show parse, plan, tool trace and confidence components; hidden by default&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving serialization.&#xa;Artifacts: AdvancedModeArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Disable this branch explicitly and preserve the deterministic core path with the reason in ExecutionTrace.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#a16207;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
