        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_VERIFY" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;C5 — Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Automatic mode] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; evidence from Optional Graph Lane [P07_GRAPH] → Grounding control f…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform evidence from Optional Graph Lane [P07_GRAPH] into output to Form…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving seriali…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; output to Formatter / Output [P07_FORMAT]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Verification boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Versioned output envelope, task formatter and provenance-preserving serialization.&#xa;Artifacts: VerificationArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
