        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_TOOLS" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D1 — Tool Registry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Control bus] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; External or page-entry input for Tool Registry on PAGE_07&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Persist and retrieve Tool Registry records by stable identifiers and run ve…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Allow-listed tool contracts with typed inputs/outputs, availability and fai…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; contracts to Bounded Agent Planner [P07_PLAN]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Tool Registry boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Allow-listed tool contracts with typed inputs/outputs, availability and failure semantics.&#xa;Artifacts: ToolRegistryArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
