        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_PLAN" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D2 — Bounded Agent Planner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[OPTIONAL: Control bus] [EXPERIMENTAL] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; contracts from Tool Registry [P07_TOOLS]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Apply allow-listed control for Bounded Agent Planner with budget, validatio…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Optional planner constrained to registered tools, explicit budgets and vali…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; plan to Plan Validator [P07_PVALID] → bounded control to Applicatio…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Bounded Agent Planner boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Optional planner constrained to registered tools, explicit budgets and validator approval.&#xa;Artifacts: BoundedAgentPlannerArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Disable this branch explicitly and preserve the deterministic core path with the reason in ExecutionTrace.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#a16207;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
