        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_PVALID" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D3 — Plan Validator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Agent enabled] [PLANNED] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; plan from Bounded Agent Planner [P07_PLAN]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Apply allow-listed control for Plan Validator with budget, validation and t…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Reject unknown tools, schema mismatches, budget violations and evidence-inv…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; validated to Budget Manager [P07_BUDGET] → Query / Retrieval contro…" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Plan Validator boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Reject unknown tools, schema mismatches, budget violations and evidence-inventing steps before execution.&#xa;Artifacts: PlanValidatorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
