        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_TRACE" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;D6 — Execution Trace&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Control bus] [BASELINE] [TEAM_DECISION]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; fallback trace from Fallback Controller [P07_FALLBACK]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate schema, version and provenance for Execution Trace before artifact…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Append-only structured trace of decisions, tool calls, versions, failures a…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; advanced only to Advanced Mode [P07_ADV]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Execution Trace boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not invent tools, IDs, timestamps, scores, identity or evidence.&#xa;Implementation: Append-only structured trace of decisions, tool calls, versions, failures and fallback reasons.&#xa;Artifacts: ExecutionTraceArtifact&#xa;Metrics: policy validity → fallback rate → control latency&#xa;Failure modes: invalid plan, unavailable tool, exhausted budget or untraceable decision&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TRI; reviewers=PHUC" style="shape=document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#713f12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
