        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_TASKFMT" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;E3 — Task Formatter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [CURRENT_TEMPLATE] [SOFTWARE_TEMPLATE]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; ranked list from Ranked Answer List Constructor [P07_RANK]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform ranked list from Ranked Answer List Constructor [P07_RANK] into t…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Serialize KIS, Q&amp;A and TRAKE candidates to their exact output contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; task rows to Submission [P07_SUBMIT]" tooltip="Responsibility: Own the Task Formatter boundary and produce only its declared page-local contracts.&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Serialize KIS, Q&amp;A and TRAKE candidates to their exact output contracts.&#xa;Artifacts: TaskFormatterArtifact&#xa;Metrics: contract validity → submission validity → serialization latency&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=TAI; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
