        <mxCell id="PAGE_07_P07_EVAL" value="&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:15px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;E5 — Official Evaluator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:10px&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[CORE: Core system] [CURRENT_TEMPLATE] [SOFTWARE_TEMPLATE]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In:&lt;/b&gt; official input from Submission [P07_SUBMIT]&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transform official input from Submission [P07_SUBMIT] into Terminal page ou…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Impl:&lt;/b&gt; Offline adapter for official metric inputs/outputs; does not claim benchmar…&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Out:&lt;/b&gt; Terminal page output: OfficialEvaluatorArtifact" tooltip="Responsibility: R@1/5/20/50/100, Final Score; video/frame/chain/moment/answer/latency/storage metrics&#xa;Non-responsibility: Does not fabricate benchmark outcomes or strip evidence provenance.&#xa;Implementation: Offline adapter for official metric inputs/outputs; does not claim benchmark results.&#xa;Artifacts: OfficialEvaluatorArtifact&#xa;Metrics: R@1 → R@5 → R@20 → R@50 → R@100 → Final Score&#xa;Failure modes: evidence/output schema mismatch or invalid task submission row&#xa;Fallback: Fail closed with a typed error and preserve the last valid versioned artifact or deterministic baseline path.&#xa;Owner: architecture=TRI; implementation=PHUC; reviewers=PHUC" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2e8f0;strokeColor=#166534;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
